msgid "Options that are not found in the configuration file"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/explanation/configuration-file.rst:25
msgid ""
"Not everything is suitable for version-specific configuration, like the "
"Git repository where the configuration file is read after cloning."
msgstr ""

